OL,3,GNEWSAMoment giant fin whale's huge
OL,4,Amouth engulfs thousands of tonnes of
OL,5,Awater
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis is the moment the planet's second
OL,8,Flargest living creature opens its giant
OL,9,Fjaws and swallows thousands of tonnes
OL,10,Fof water during feeding.
OL,12,FThe fin whale was filmed by
OL,13,Fvideographer Rhys Morgan off the
OL,14,FPembrokeshire coast in Wales, and it
OL,15,Fshows the mammal's expandable pleats
OL,16,Ftake in up to 18,000 gallons of water
OL,17,Fand krill.
OL,19,FMorgan said "it was complete luck" that
OL,20,Fhe captured the whale feeding and
OL,21,Fswimming with dolphins on his drone
OL,22,Fwhile fishing with a friend.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
