OL,3,GNEWSAMoment giant fin whale's huge
OL,4,Amouth engulfs thousands of tonnes of
OL,5,Awater
OL,6,
OL,7,FSecond only to the blue whale, the fin
OL,8,Fwhale is one of the largest animals
OL,9,Fever to have lived, reaching up to 24m
OL,10,Fin length and weighing up to 70 tonnes.
